<main  class="container cdc-main" role="main" aria-label="Main Content Area">
	
<section class="cdc-page-title-bar cdc-page-offset noindex">
			<time class="cdc-page-title-bar__item cdc-page-title-bar__item--date" datetime="2024-06-25 04:00:00">
			June 25, 2024		</time>
		</section>
<div class="cdc-page-title cdc-page-offset syndicate">
		<h1>People at Increased Risk for Heat-Related Illness</h1>	</div>
	<div id="content" class="cdc-page-content cdc-page-offset syndicate container">
		<div class="cdc-dfe-body ">
	<div class="cdc-dfe-body__top ">
		<div class="dfe-section dfe-section--page-summary summary-blurb summary-list" data-section="cdc_risk_factors_page_summary">
			<div class="dfe-section__header">
		<h2>Key points</h2>
		</div>
		<div class="dfe-section__content">
		<ul class="nested-list">
<li class="level-1">Some people are at a higher risk of getting sick from the heat than others.<ul>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="level-1">Learn what to do if you or someone you care for is at a higher risk of getting sick on hot days.<ul>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
			</div>
		<div id="nav-buttons">

	</div>
</div>
	</div>
		<div class="cdc-dfe-body__center ">
		<div class="dfe-section" data-section="cdc_risk_factors_overview">
	<a class="onThisPageAnchor" id="cdc_risk_factors_overview-stay-safe-on-hot-days" name="Stay%20safe%20on%20hot%20days" title="Stay safe on hot days"><!-- --></a><h2>Stay safe on hot days</h2>
<h3>Older Adults (Aged 65+)</h3>
<figure class="dfe-image dfe-image__large"><div class="image-container calculated-ratio-16-9 aspect-ratio-16-9"><img src="/heat-health/media/images/2024/seniorafricanamericanwomanwearingsunglassesandhat.jpg" alt="Woman wearing sunglasses and sun hat outside"></div>
<div class="dfe-image-caption-container"><figcaption class="dfe-image-caption" id="caption-623-6697fcf2c9a96">People aged 65 years or older are more prone to heat-related health problems.</figcaption></div></figure>
<p>People aged 65 years or older are more prone to heat-related health problems. If you&rsquo;re an older adult or a caretaker, learn how you or the person you&rsquo;re caring for can stay safe during the heat.</p>
<p><strong>Learn more:</strong></p>
<ul class="nested-list">
<li class="level-1"><a href="/heat-health/risk-factors/heat-and-older-adults-aged-65.html" class="">Heat and Older Adults (Aged 65+)</a><ul>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3>Infants and Children</h3>
<figure class="dfe-image dfe-image__large"><div class="image-container calculated-ratio-16-9 aspect-ratio-16-9"><img src="/heat-health/media/images/2024/heatandchildren.jpg" alt="Kids are smiling"></div>
<div class="dfe-image-caption-container"><figcaption class="dfe-image-caption" id="caption-618-6697fcf2c9cc8">Take steps to protect kids from heat.</figcaption></div></figure>
<p>Infants and young children rely on others to keep them cool and hydrated when it&rsquo;s hot outside. Take steps to protect kids from heat.</p>
<p><strong>Learn more:</strong></p>
<ul class="nested-list">
<li class="level-1"><a href="/heat-health/risk-factors/infants-and-children.html" class="">Heat and Infants and Children</a><ul>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3>People with Chronic Conditions</h3>
<figure class="dfe-image dfe-image__large"><div class="image-container calculated-ratio-16-9 aspect-ratio-16-9"><img src="/heat-health/media/images/2024/senior-woman-drinking-water.jpg" alt="Senior woman drinking water"></div>
<div class="dfe-image-caption-container"><figcaption class="dfe-image-caption" id="caption-624-6697fcf2c9f68">Heat can be especially dangerous for those with chronic medical conditions.</figcaption></div></figure>
<p>Hot days can be dangerous for anyone, but they can be especially dangerous for those with chronic medical conditions. If you or someone you know has a chronic medical condition, learn how to help keep you, or the person in your care, safe.</p>
<p><strong>Learn more:</strong></p>
<ul class="nested-list">
<li class="level-1"><a href="/heat-health/risk-factors/heat-and-chronic-conditions.html" class="">Heat and Chronic Conditions</a><ul>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3>People without Air Conditioning</h3>
<figure class="dfe-image dfe-image__large"><div class="image-container calculated-ratio-16-9 aspect-ratio-16-9"><img src="/heat-health/media/images/2024/portrait-of-young-woman.jpg" alt="Portrait of young woman"></div>
<div class="dfe-image-caption-container"><figcaption class="dfe-image-caption" id="caption-620-6697fcf2ca1fe">Prepare ahead of time for heat this summer.</figcaption></div></figure>
<p>Prepare ahead of time for heat this summer, especially if air conditioning is not available in your home.</p>
<p><strong>Learn more:</strong></p>
<ul class="nested-list">
<li class="level-1"><a href="/heat-health/risk-factors/heat-and-low-income.html" class="">Heat and People without Air Conditioning</a><ul>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3>Athletes</h3>
<figure class="dfe-image dfe-image__large"><div class="image-container calculated-ratio-16-9 aspect-ratio-16-9"><img src="/heat-health/media/images/2024/african-american-girl-smiling-with-her-soccer-team.jpg" alt="Girl smiling with her soccer team"></div>
<div class="dfe-image-caption-container"><figcaption class="dfe-image-caption" id="caption-606-6697fcf2ca41b">Take steps to protect your health during heat.</figcaption></div></figure>
<p>People who exercise in heat are more likely to become dehydrated and get heat-related illness. Take steps to protect your health and the health of others on hot days.</p>
<p><strong>Learn more:</strong></p>
<ul class="nested-list">
<li class="level-1"><a href="/heat-health/risk-factors/heat-and-athletes.html" class="">Heat and Athletes</a><ul>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3>Outdoor Workers</h3>
<figure class="dfe-image dfe-image__large"><div class="image-container calculated-ratio-16-9 aspect-ratio-16-9"><img src="/heat-health/media/images/2024/construction-workers-smiling.jpg" alt="Construction workers smiling"></div>
<div class="dfe-image-caption-container"><figcaption class="dfe-image-caption" id="caption-619-6697fcf2ca61f">If you are an outdoor worker, protect yourself during heat.</figcaption></div></figure>
<p>People who work outdoors are more likely to become dehydrated and get heat-related illness. Take steps to protect your health on hot days.</p>
<p><strong>Learn more:</strong></p>
<ul class="nested-list">
<li class="level-1"><a href="/heat-health/risk-factors/heat-and-outdoor-workers.html" class="">Heat and Outdoor Workers</a><ul>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3>Pregnancy</h3>
<figure class="dfe-image dfe-image__large"><div class="image-container calculated-ratio-16-9 aspect-ratio-16-9"><img src="/heat-health/media/images/2024/pregnant-woman-drinking-water-in-hot-weather.jpg" alt="Pregnant woman drinking water in hot weather"></div>
<div class="dfe-image-caption-container"><figcaption class="dfe-image-caption" id="caption-621-6697fcf2ca819">Protect you and your developing baby's health during heat.</figcaption></div></figure>
<p>Pregnancy can make you more likely to get sick when it&rsquo;s very hot. If you are pregnant, know what you can do to protect you and your developing baby from heat.</p>
<p><strong>Learn more:</strong></p>
<ul class="nested-list">
<li class="level-1"><a href="/heat-health/risk-factors/heat-and-pregnancy.html" class="">Heat and Pregnancy</a><ul>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>

</div>
	</div>
